---
layout: _layouts/base.njk
section: transmissions
description: Sealed transmissions from sp3ctr-zone. Hover an entry to decrypt the preview, open it for the rest.
extraScripts:
  - /js/cipher.js
---
<h1>transmissions</h1>
<p class="prompt">newest first. hover, tab, or tap an entry to decrypt its opening
  line — step away and it reseals. open one to read the whole thing.</p>

<div class="log">
  <div class="signal"><span class="signal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> SIGNAL LOCKED &middot; {{ collections.transmissions.length }} TRANSMISSIONS ON FILE</div>
{% for entry in collections.transmissions | reverse %}
  <a class="entry" href="{{ entry.url }}" data-cipher-trigger>
    <span class="entry-head">
      <span class="entry-date">{{ entry.date | dateDisplay }}</span>
      <span class="entry-subject">{{ entry.data.title }}</span>
    </span>
    {# only the opening paragraph is on this page at all — the rest of the
       transmission exists solely on its own page. #}
    <span class="cipher" data-seal>{{ entry.templateContent | firstParagraph }}</span>
    <span class="entry-open" aria-hidden="true">open transmission</span>
  </a>
{% endfor %}
</div>
